FRR (zebra / bgpd) \u3092 vrf-aware \u5316\u3057\u3001SONiC \u5074\u306b vrfmgrd / vrforch \u3092\u65b0\u8a2d\u3057\u3066 L3 interface\u30fbstatic route\u30fbBGP \u30bb\u30c3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30fbACL redirect \u306e VRF binding \u3092\u4e00\u6c17\u901a\u8cab\u3067\u6271\u3046\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/routing/sonic-vrf-support-design-spec-draft.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T11:27:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T21:05:37+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/dataplane-telemetry-test-plan/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/dataplane-telemetry-test-plan/", "title": "Dataplane Telemetry (DTel) \u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3\uff08INT source/sink/transit + Postcard + Drop/Queue report\uff09", "content_html": "Dataplane Telemetry (DTel) \u306e\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3\u3002INT source / sink / transit\u3001Postcard\u3001Drop report\u3001Queue report \u306e\u5404\u6a5f\u80fd\u3092 PTF + sonic-mgmt \u3067\u691c\u8a3c\u3059\u308b\u8a2d\u8a08\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/system/dataplane-telemetry-test-plan.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T11:27:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T20:42:09+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/", "title": "gNMI / gNOI / OpenConfig / YANG", "content_html": "gNMI / gNOI / OpenConfig / YANG \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u306e\u300c\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u99c6\u52d5\u7ba1\u7406\u300d\u3092\u3001\u30ea\u30af\u30a8\u30b9\u30c8\u304c\u5165\u308b\u5165\u53e3\u304b\u3089 ConfigDB \u306b\u5230\u9054\u3059\u308b\u307e\u3067\u306e\u9806\u3067\u8aad\u307f\u76f4\u3059\u305f\u3081\u306e\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T11:27:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:29:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/yang-reference/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/yang-reference/", "title": "YANG \u30ea\u30d5\u30a1\u30ec\u30f3\u30b9", "content_html": "\u672c\u66f8\u306e\u6a5f\u80fd\u7ae0 01\u301c21 \u304b\u3089 SONiC native YANG \u30e2\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u9006\u5f15\u304d\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306e\u7d22\u5f15\u3002\u5404\u7ae0\u306b\u3069\u306e sonic-*.yang \u304c\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3059\u308b\u304b\u3092 1 \u8868\u3067\u793a\u3057\u3001`docs/reference/yang/*.md` \u306e\u500b\u5225\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306b\u63a5\u7d9a\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/yang-reference.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T11:27:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:29:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/12-multi-asic-voq/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/12-multi-asic-voq/", "title": "Multi-ASIC / VOQ Chassis", "content_html": "Multi-ASIC / VOQ Chassis \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u304c\u300c1 \u3064\u306e NOS \u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30b9\u3067\u8907\u6570 ASIC \u3092\u3001\u307e\u305f\u306f\u8907\u6570 line card \u3092 1 \u3064\u306e\u8ad6\u7406\u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u3068\u3057\u3066\u898b\u305b\u308b\u300d\u305f\u3081\u306e\u4ed5\u7d44\u307f\u3092\u307e\u3068\u3081\u3066\u8aad\u3080\u305f\u3081\u306e\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/12-multi-asic-voq/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T11:27:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:29:50+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/12-multi-asic-voq/concept/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/12-multi-asic-voq/concept/", "title": "\u6982\u5ff5", "content_html": "\u6982\u5ff5 \u2014 Multi-ASIC \u3068 VOQ chassis \u306f\u5225\u306e\u8a71\u306b\u898b\u3048\u3066\u6bb5\u968e\u7684\u306b\u3064\u306a\u304c\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u3053\u3067\u306f pizza-box 1 ASIC \u3092\u57fa\u6e96\u306b\u3001\u3069\u3053\u304b\u3089\u300cMulti-ASIC\u300d\u306b\u306a\u308a\u3001\u3069\u3053\u304b\u3089\u300cVOQ chassis\u300d\u306b\u306a\u308b\u306e\u304b\u3092\u8a00\u8449\u306e\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u3067\u6574\u7406\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/12-multi-asic-voq/concept.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T11:27:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:29:50+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/22-reference-index/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/22-reference-index/", "title": "\u30ea\u30d5\u30a1\u30ec\u30f3\u30b9\u6a2a\u65ad\u7d22\u5f15", "content_html": "\u30ea\u30d5\u30a1\u30ec\u30f3\u30b9\u6a2a\u65ad\u7d22\u5f15 \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001docs/reference/ \u914d\u4e0b\u306b\u96c6\u3081\u305f CLI / CONFIG_DB / YANG \u306e\u8f9e\u66f8\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3068\u3001\u6a5f\u80fd\u7ae0 (docs/topics/) \u3068\u306e\u9593\u3092\u884c\u304d\u6765\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306e\u7d22\u5f15\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/22-reference-index/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T11:27:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:31:40+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}]}